# S3 Multipart Cleanup - Bucket Exception List
# ==============================================
# 
# Add bucket names or patterns (one per line) to exclude from cleanup.
# Lines starting with # are comments.
#
# Supports:
#   - Exact bucket names: my-special-bucket
#   - Glob patterns: my-app-*-critical, *-compliance-*
#
# Common exclusions:
#   - Long-running data ingestion buckets
#   - Compliance/regulated data buckets
#   - External integration buckets
#   - Buckets with custom lifecycle requirements

# ============================================
# LONG-RUNNING UPLOAD BUCKETS
# ============================================
# These buckets have legitimate uploads that may take >7 days
# data-lake-ingestion-prod
# etl-staging-*
# backup-archive-*

# ============================================
# COMPLIANCE / REGULATED BUCKETS
# ============================================
# Buckets with Object Lock or special compliance requirements
# *-compliance-*
# *-audit-*
# hipaa-*
# pci-*

# ============================================
# EXTERNAL INTEGRATIONS
# ============================================
# Buckets used by third-party services or partners
# vendor-*-integration
# partner-data-*

# ============================================
# AWS SERVICE BUCKETS
# ============================================
# Buckets managed by AWS services (may have restrictions)
# aws-cloudtrail-logs-*
# aws-config-*
# elasticbeanstalk-*

# ============================================
# SPECIAL PIPELINES
# ============================================
# Add your specific exclusions below:




